# M035 P05 T05 fixture placeholder. Real signing certificates are
# produced by .github/workflows/release.yml (T03) at release time
# via cosign's keyless flow against the GitHub Actions OIDC issuer
# (token.actions.githubusercontent.com). This placeholder lets the
# shape-mode verifier pass without requiring a real Fulcio cert.
# Live cosign verification is gated behind COSIGN_AVAILABLE=1 +
# M035_P05_LIVE_RELEASE_DIR env vars.
